C:Assign T: RAM:
C:FailAt 21
C:LoadModule DEVS:fujinet-disk.device
C:fmount 11 0 RO >NIL:
C:Mount DN0: FROM DEVS:DN0
C:Wait 2 SECS
C:fmount_inhibit_exp_b DH0:exp-b-true.result 12 >NIL:
C:Wait 1 SECS
C:Dir DN0: >DH0:exp-b-type.result
C:Type DN0:SECOND.TXT >>DH0:exp-b-type.result
C:Type DH0:exp-b-true.result
C:FLS host:/amiga-e2e-complete/diskdevice-inhibit-exp-b >NIL:
C:Type DH0:exp-b-true.result
C:Type DH0:exp-b-type.result
C:Echo "E2E COMPLETE"
